          "groupName": "Meat Sauce",
          "sortOrder": 1
        },
        {
          "title": "Brown the beef",
          "body": "Brown the ground beef well, then combine it with the vegetables, cumin and tomato paste. Cook for another couple of minutes while stirring.",
