          "groupName": "Meat Sauce",
          "sortOrder": 2
        },
        {
          "title": "Simmer the sauce",
          "body": "Add the red wine and beef stock. Simmer for about 20 minutes, until the sauce has thickened slightly. Season with salt and black pepper.",
