          "groupName": "Meat Sauce",
          "sortOrder": 3
        },
        {
          "title": "Make the sweet potato mash",
          "body": "Peel the sweet potatoes and cut them into small pieces. Boil in lightly salted water until completely tender. Drain, then mash with the butter and cream or Gryr. Season with salt and black pepper.",
