        {
          "title": "Cook the aromatics",
          "body": "Wipe out the pan and add 1 tablespoon of toasted sesame oil. Add the garlic, ginger and chilli with a pinch of salt and the brown sugar. Fry for 2 minutes, then add the drained mince and stir well.",
